 :why-the-ledger-cannot-be-run-scoped
 "no field of a tension or an event names a run: the keys in use are [:event/at :event/by :event/evidence :event/id :event/note :event/row :event/seq :event/tension :event/to-status :event/type] on events and [:tension/born-of :tension/carried-by :tension/id :tension/minted-by :tension/pattern-links :tension/poles :tension/provenance :tension/refusal :tension/resolution-key :tension/resolution-path :tension/statement :tension/statement-source :tension/statement-source-corrected-by :tension/status] on tensions, of which [] carry a run. The nearest carrier is :event/at, a DATE, and a date is not provenance: two lanes writing on the same day would both match. U39's mint payload does carry :tension/provenance {:records [run-id ...]}, and no committed tension was minted that way.",
